    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27838" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοιοί</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αί</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>two, both,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				432
			</span></i>, etc.: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοιά</span> as
				Adv., <i>in two ways, in two points,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοιός, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,</span>
			<i>twofold, double,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				17.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.46
			</span></i> (Antip. Thess.), etc.—
				Ep.
			 word, also 
				Dor.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).378
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thera</span>), and <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
